      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VELOCITY COMMIT (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (19.84) at this track behind Cambla Diva in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Deserves serious consideration. VELOCITY SMOLDER (8) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Daintree Tommy (20.06) in a Grade 5. Worked home well on that occasion and should be strong late. Leading chance. DREAMER (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (20.42) in a Mix 5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Leading chance. CLASSIC BOODIE (5) is worth some thought after showing speed and filling a placing last start.",
